[{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0098","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0098.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-16133","title":"Cybrotech CyBroHttpServer 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Cybrotech CyBroHttpServer 1.0.3 存在目录遍历漏洞，该漏洞源于程序对用户请求 URI 中的 ../ 序列过滤不严。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的包含 ../ 路径穿越序列的 HTTP 请求，突破目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击无需任何权限或用户交互，利用方式简单，已有公开 PoC 可用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-16133"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-08-29T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:43:44Z","remediation":"升级 CyBroHttpServer 至官方修复版本（如存在），或在 Web 服务器配置中拦截包含 `../` 的 URI 请求。如无法升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）添加规则：`if ($uri ~* \"\\.\\.\") { return 403; }`，并限制 Web 服务运行账户对敏感系统目录的读取权限。建议迁移至仍在维护的替代 HTTP 服务器软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://emreovunc.com/blog/en/CyBroHttpServer-v.1.0.3-Directory-Traversal-3.png","https://github.com/EmreOvunc/CyBroHttpServer-v1.0.3-Directory-Traversal","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45303/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45303","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16133.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-16133.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16133.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-16133.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-16133-3358.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-16133-3355.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-16133-3356.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-16133-3357.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2018-16133.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/CyBroHttpServer/CVE-2018-16133.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2018/16xxx/CVE-2018-16133.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0098.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0094","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0094.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-15535","title":"tecrail Responsive FileManager 路径遍历漏洞","description":"tecrail Responsive FileManager 9.13.4 之前版本中的 /filemanager/ajax_calls.php 存在路径遍历漏洞。该漏洞源于程序使用外部输入构造路径名时未正确过滤 \"..\" 序列，导致攻击者可通过构造特制的路径参数突破目录限制，实现任意文件读取。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响范围广泛。成功利用该漏洞可读取服务器上的敏感文件，如配置文件、数据库凭证等，导致信息泄露。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-15535"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-08-24T19:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:42:43Z","remediation":"将 tecrail Responsive FileManager 升级至 9.13.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复 /filemanager/ajax_calls.php 中未正确过滤 ../ 序列导致的目录遍历问题。如无法立即升级，在 Web 服务器（如 Nginx/Apache）配置中限制 /filemanager/ 目录的访问权限，仅允许可信 IP 访问，并禁用对 ajax_calls.php 的直接外部请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Aug/34","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45271/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-15535.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-15535.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-15535.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-15535.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-15535-3338.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-15535-3335.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-15535-3336.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-15535-3339.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-15535.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-15535.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2018/15xxx/CVE-2018-15535.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0094.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0168","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-11776","title":"Apache Struts2 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apache Struts2 框架在 2.3 至 2.3.34 及 2.5 至 2.5.16 版本中存在远程命令执行漏洞（S2-057）。当 alwaysSelectFullNamespace 配置为 true 时（可由用户或 Convention 插件触发），攻击者可通过构造无命名空间的请求结果或使用未设置 value 和 action 的 url 标签，结合上层包的无命名空间或通配符命名空间配置，注入并执行任意 OGNL 表达式。该漏洞影响使用受影响版本的所有 Apache Struts2 Web 应用，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。Apache 官方已在 2.18.3 和 2.5.17 版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户立即升级。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-11776"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-08-22T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:36:34Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apache Struts 至 2.3.35（2.3.x 分支）或 2.5.17（2.5.x 分支），两个版本均包含完整的漏洞修复且预计不存在向后兼容性问题。如因业务原因无法立即升级，可采取临时缓解措施：在 struts.xml 中确保所有 package 元素显式配置 namespace 属性，为所有 result 定义设置 namespace，并在 JSP 的 url 标签中强制填写 value 或 action 属性；同时将 alwaysSelectFullNamespace 设为 false（除非必须为 true）。升级后若日志出现 ArrayList 被排除的 WARN，需在 struts.xml 中定义 struts.excludedPackageNames 常量，排除 ognl.、javax.、freemarker.core. 等相关包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/172830/Apache-Struts-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.arubanetworks.com/assets/alert/ARUBA-PSA-2018-005.txt","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/alert-cve-2018-11776-5072787.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpuoct2018-4428296.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105125","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041547","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041888","https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/WW/S2-057","https://github.com/hook-s3c/CVE-2018-11776-Python-PoC","https://lgtm.com/blog/apache_struts_CVE-2018-11776","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r6d03e45b81eab03580cf7f8bb51cb3e9a1b10a2cc0c6a2d3cc92ed0c%40%3Cannounce.apache.org%3E","https://psirt.global.sonicwall.com/vuln-detail/SNWLID-2018-0012","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20180822-0001/","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20181018-0002/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45260/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45262/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45367/","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujul2020.html","https://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpujan2019-5072801.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-11776","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45262","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11776.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-11776.md","https://github.com/qazbnm456/awesome-cve-poc/blob/fc862e38e03ea68cdc62618d14891a426daff1a4/CVE-2018-11776.md","https://github.com/fofapro/vulfocus/blob/4b7a2eaacce4ed770f289e6e72f7240da1e16c74/writeup/CVE-2018-11776/CVE-2018-11776.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/中间件漏洞/Apache Struts2 S2-057 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2018-11776.md","https://github.com/ym2011/POC-EXP/blob/206b22d3a6b2a172359678df33bbc5b2ad04b6c3/Struts2/S2-057/CVE-2018-11776/README.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/589d7992aa3758a5c4c771032cd64233f6f0054f/data/by-cve/CVE-2018-11776.md","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-11776.js","https://github.com/ym2011/POC-EXP/blob/206b22d3a6b2a172359678df33bbc5b2ad04b6c3/Struts2/S2-057/CVE-2018-11776/s2-057.py","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/589d7992aa3758a5c4c771032cd64233f6f0054f/data/2018/CVE-2018-11776-Ekultek_Strutter.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/589d7992aa3758a5c4c771032cd64233f6f0054f/data/2018/CVE-2018-11776-m4sk0ff_CVE-2018-11776.md","https://github.com/mazen160/struts-pwn_CVE-2018-11776","https://github.com/649/Apache-Struts-Shodan-Exploit","https://github.com/Ekultek/Strutter","https://github.com/brianwrf/S2-057-CVE-2018-11776"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0021","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-1000226","title":"Cobbler XMLRPC API 访问控制不当导致权限提升漏洞","description":"Cobbler 的 XMLRPC API（`/cobbler_api`）端点在验证安全令牌时存在缺陷，导致访问控制失效。远程未经身份验证的攻击者可通过网络连接发送特制的请求，绕过权限检查实现权限提升。攻击者可利用此漏洞操纵系统数据、窃取敏感信息，甚至通过 API 接口收割 LDAP 凭据。该漏洞影响 Cobbler 2.6.11 及 2.0.0 以上的多个版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-1000226"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-08-20T20:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:32:43Z","remediation":"建议将 Cobbler 升级至 2.6.12 或更高版本。若无法立即升级，应通过防火墙限制 /cobbler_api 接口的访问权限，仅允许可信的内部管理 IP 访问，以防止远程未经授权的权限提升攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/cobbler/cobbler/issues/1916","https://movermeyer.com/2018-08-02-privilege-escalation-exploits-in-cobblers-api/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1000226.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-1000226.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/ab255c7216ed287f101e0ef82a9ced7168026cd9/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1000226.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-1000226.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-1000226-3140.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-1000226-3138.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-1000226-3139.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Cobbler/CVE-2018-1000226.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cobbler/CVE-2018-1000226.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-1000226.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/43e577059b53e108361552e3e4ed7215e962f6d4/plugins/cobblerd/cobbler/CVE-2018-1000226.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0021.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0021.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0057","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0057.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-11511","title":"ASUSTOR ADM 3.1.0.RFQ3 Photo Gallery Application SQL注入","description":"ASUSTOR ADM 3.1.0.RFQ3 Photo Gallery应用中存在SQL注入漏洞。该应用的树列表功能在处理 'album_id' 或 'scope' 参数时缺乏有效的输入验证和SQL查询参数化，导致攻击者能够向photo-gallery/api/album/tree_lists/端点发送恶意参数嵌入恶意SQL代码。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可利用此漏洞访问、修改或删除数据库中的所有数据，甚至可能执行系统命令和获取控制权，威胁系统安全。该漏洞广泛存在于ASUSTOR ADM 3.1.0.RFQ3版本中，由于攻击向量为网络远程，攻击者无需任何权限即可触发，攻击成功率极高。漏洞危害等级极高，CVSS评分达到9.8，评估为严重威胁，攻击者只需要简单构造的恶意请求即可成功利用该漏洞，导致系统数据泄露、破坏或被完全控制。Microsoft已发布安全更新补丁，但许多用户未及时更新，仍然暴露在攻击之下。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-11511"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-08-16T20:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:36:05Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 ASUSTOR ADM 至 3.1.1 或更高版本（官方已在 2018 年 8 月修复该 SQL 注入漏洞）。如无法立即升级，请在 ADM 控制台禁用「照片图库」应用，或在防火墙/反向代理层面限制对 /photo-gallery/api/album/tree_lists/ 接口的访问，并配置 WAF 规则拦截针对 album_id/scope 参数的 SQL 注入载荷（如单引号、UNION SELECT、SLEEP 等特征）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/148919/ASUSTOR-NAS-ADM-3.1.0-Remote-Command-Execution-SQL-Injection.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45200/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45200","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11511.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-11511.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/a62de47c20334aaaeb69edbcd7906d54bc3e60ae/2018/CVE-2018-11511.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/66442328eb507ff4cc70a08b8d06ef2b17368786/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11511.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2018/11xxx/CVE-2018-11511.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/asustor/asustor-data-master/CVE-2018-11511.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-11511.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-11511.md","https://github.com/crowdsecurity/hub/blob/f54b5ba9e6bf0d7144a93aea6865910b98ef9998/appsec-rules/crowdsecurity/vpatch-CVE-2018-11511.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-11511.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-11511.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-1108","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-1108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8414","title":"Microsoft Windows Shell 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows Shell 在处理文件路径时由于缺乏足够的验证，导致存在远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者可以通过诱导用户打开一个精心构造的恶意文件（如快捷方式或特定路径文件），利用该路径校验缺陷触发漏洞，从而在受害者系统中以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞主要影响 Windows 10 及其服务器版本，CVSS 评分为 8.8，具有较高的威胁等级。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8414"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-08-15T17:29:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:04:48Z","remediation":"建议立即安装微软 2018 年 8 月发布的累积安全更新（如 Windows 10 版本的 KB4035129 或相关补丁），通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 下载安装，以修复 Windows Shell 的路径验证漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105016","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041458","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2018-8414","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-8414","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8414.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f7fdc93b8d4d470f2c23e4fffbdda828848b6048/2018/CVE-2018-8414.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/077172bcea3338bafb871871e211bbb7c87f3c3c/2018/8xxx/CVE-2018-8414.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-8414.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-8414.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-8414.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-8414.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/4d788f269ad44a501a2252f60eed87a3837ec472/2018/CVE-2018-8414/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-8414.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-8414.rules","https://github.com/whereisr0da/CVE-2018-8414-POC"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-1108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0027","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8406","title":"Microsoft Windows DirectX 图形内核特权提升漏洞","description":"该漏洞属于特权提升漏洞，其核心原因在于 DirectX 图形内核（DXGKRNL）驱动程序在处理内存对象时存在不当的操作，导致内存管理失效。本地攻击者可通过运行特制的恶意应用程序，利用该驱动程序的缺陷来篡改内核内存，从而将进程权限从普通用户提升至系统级权限（SYSTEM）。该漏洞影响 Windows 10、Windows 10 Server 以及 Windows Server 2016 等多个版本。攻击者必须在目标系统上拥有低权限账户并能够执行代码方可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8406"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-08-15T17:29:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:04:47Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2018 年 8 月安全更新：Windows 10 Version 1803 安装 KB4346783，Version 1709 安装 KB4346787，Version 1703 安装 KB4346785，Version 1607 及 Windows Server 2016 安装 KB4343895，或通过 Windows Update 自动更新至最新版本。如无法立即打补丁，可临时限制本地用户账户权限并禁用不必要的 DirectX 图形硬件加速功能，以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105012","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041461","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2018-8406","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-8406","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8406.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/231116aa5795023b4be954f9aed84939e97cf046/cves/2018/8xxx/CVE-2018-8406.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/077172bcea3338bafb871871e211bbb7c87f3c3c/2018/8xxx/CVE-2018-8406.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8405.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-8406.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-8406.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-8406.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-8406.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-84xx/CVE-2018-8406.json","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/2f11bc91c106aa93748d5788e09a11c404412298/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2018-8406"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0027.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0025","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8405","title":"Microsoft Windows DirectX 图形内核特权提升漏洞","description":"DirectX 图形内核（DXGKRNL）驱动程序在处理内存对象时存在不当操作，导致特权提升漏洞。攻击者在获得目标系统低权限账户后，可通过运行特制的恶意代码触发该漏洞，从而将权限提升至系统最高级别。该漏洞影响 Windows 10、Windows 8.1、Windows RT 8.1 及 Windows Server 2012 R2、2016 等多个版本，可导致系统完整性受损及敏感信息泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8405"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-08-15T17:29:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:04:47Z","remediation":"建议立即安装微软 2018 年 8 月发布的累积更新或月度汇总更新（如 Windows 10 对应的 KB4036441 等相关补丁），或通过 Windows Update 自动更新至最新版本，以修复 DirectX 图形内核驱动程序的内存处理缺陷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105011","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041461","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2018-8405","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-8405","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8405.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/231116aa5795023b4be954f9aed84939e97cf046/cves/2018/8xxx/CVE-2018-8405.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/077172bcea3338bafb871871e211bbb7c87f3c3c/2018/8xxx/CVE-2018-8405.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8406.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-8405.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-8405.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-8405.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-8405.json","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/2f11bc91c106aa93748d5788e09a11c404412298/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2018-8405","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-8405.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0025.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-1106","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-1106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8373","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 脚本引擎内存损坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 脚本引擎在处理内存对象时存在内存损坏漏洞（CWE-787）。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制的恶意网页，利用脚本引擎在处理特定对象时的内存管理缺陷触发该漏洞。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 9、10 及 11 版本，攻击者一旦成功触发即可在目标系统上实现远程代码执行（RCE），导致攻击者获得系统权限并执行任意指令。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8373"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-08-15T17:29:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:04:43Z","remediation":"建议立即安装微软 2018 年 8 月的安全更新（针对 IE 9/10/11），通过 Windows Update 自动更新或手动下载安装对应版本的补丁。作为临时缓解措施，建议用户避免访问不可信的恶意网页，或在企业环境中强制启用增强型安全配置 (ESC) 限制脚本执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105037","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041483","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2018-8373","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-8373","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8373.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9aee4694c57e6f549d7f2ae075baefe98f4ec05f/2018/8xxx/CVE-2018-8373.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8353.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8359.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8390.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-8373.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8372.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8355.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8371.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-8373.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-1106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0092","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0092.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-15138","title":"Ericsson-LG iPECS NMS 30M 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Ericsson-LG iPECS NMS 30M 网络管理系统存在路径遍历漏洞，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 `/ipecs-cm/download?filename=../` 接口发送特制的 URL 请求，利用 `../` 路径穿越符读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 iPECS NMS 30M 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者只需网络可达即可远程利用，无需任何权限或用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-15138"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-08-15T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:42:06Z","remediation":"立即将 Ericsson-LG iPECS NMS 30M 升级至不受影响的最新版本（如已停产则迁移至替代产品）。如无法升级，在反向代理或 WAF 层面添加规则，拦截对 /ipecs-cm/download?filename= 路径中包含 ../ 的请求；同时限制管理界面仅允许受信任内网 IP 访问，并禁用不必要的文件下载功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45167/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-15138.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-15138.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-15138.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-15138.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-15138-3328.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-15138-3326.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-15138-3329.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-15138-3327.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2018-15138.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/iPECS NMS 30M/CVE-2018-15138.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2018/15xxx/CVE-2018-15138.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0092.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0400","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-15133","title":"Laravel Laravel Framework 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Laravel 框架 5.5.40 及之前版本、5.6.x 至 5.6.29 版本中存在反序列化远程代码执行漏洞。该漏洞源于框架对 X-XSRF-TOKEN 值的解密处理不当，在 Illuminate/Encryption/Encrypter.php 的 decrypt 方法中调用了不安全的 unserialize 函数，攻击者可构造恶意的序列化载荷通过 XSRF Token 传递触发反序列化，结合 phpggc 工具中的 Laravel RCE 链实现远程代码执行。利用该漏洞需要获取应用的 APP_KEY，通常难以获得，但若攻击者此前已获得特权访问或成功实施过其他攻击，则可能获取该密钥。CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高，影响范围广泛。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-15133"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-08-09T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:42:06Z","remediation":"立即将 Laravel 框架升级至 5.6.30 或更高版本（5.5.x 用户升级至 5.5.41+）。升级后 Laravel 默认禁用 Cookie 序列化，消除反序列化攻击路径。如无法立即升级，在 `app/Http/Middleware/EncryptCookies.php` 中将 `$serialize` 属性设为 `false` 以禁用 Cookie 序列化，并立即轮换 `APP_KEY` 环境变量，防止已泄露密钥被利用。同时审查服务器日志排查是否有异常反序列化行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153641/PHP-Laravel-Framework-Token-Unserialize-Remote-Command-Execution.html","https://laravel.com/docs/5.6/upgrade#upgrade-5.6.30","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-15133","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47129","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-15133.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/bed70a0a2e2dec8bd34bd440f68f32280391094f/2018/CVE-2018-15133.json","https://github.com/PortSwigger/BChecks/blob/7117c5ff8d1d47ca6282020a243b4d3026480ad5/vulnerabilities-CVEd/CVE-2018-15133-Laravel RCE.bcheck","https://github.com/grisuno/LazyOwn/blob/bd1645eae749e0ca2cbf296358a126fa54e53d45/modules/CVE-2018-15133.php","https://github.com/lal0ne/vulnerability/blob/5b9f397c1970203b1764fb7a66a0ffac39bef4cc/laravel/CVE-2018-15133/README.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2018/15xxx/CVE-2018-15133.json","https://github.com/kozmic/laravel-poc-CVE-2018-15133/blob/726b31ecfa497f1320ffcccba0dac94b991bb9f9/cve-2018-15133.php","https://github.com/lal0ne/vulnerability/blob/5b9f397c1970203b1764fb7a66a0ffac39bef4cc/laravel/CVE-2018-15133/pwn_laravel.py","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2018/15xxx/CVE-2018-15133.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/78f6b1731532530a1ff639ea0b08b84d975b4e39/data/by-cve/CVE-2018-15133.md","https://github.com/kozmic/laravel-poc-CVE-2018-15133","https://github.com/aljavier/exploit_laravel_cve-2018-15133","https://github.com/pwnedshell/Larascript","https://github.com/Prabesh01/Laravel-PHP-Unit-RCE-Auto-shell-uploader","https://github.com/AzhariKun/CVE-2018-15133"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0400.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0400.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0400.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0333","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0333.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-14933","title":"NUUO NVRmini 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"NUUO NVRmini 系列网络视频录像机（NVR）的 `upgrade_handle.php` 接口存在 OS 命令注入漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 `uploaddir` 参数注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符）构造恶意 `writeuploaddir` 命令，从而在设备上以 root 权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 NUUO NVRMini2 及同系列设备，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者无需任何认证即可远程利用，可完全控制设备。目前已有公开的 Metasploit 利用模块，建议立即升级固件或限制管理接口的访问权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-14933"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-08-04T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:41:54Z","remediation":"NUUO 已宣布 NVRmini 2 及 NVRsolo 系列产品停止支持（EoL），不会发布安全补丁。建议立即停止使用受影响设备，迁移至受支持的替代产品。如无法立即替换，应在网络边界防火墙处阻断对设备 80/443 端口的公网访问，仅允许受信任内网 IP 访问设备 Web 管理界面，并部署 WAF 规则拦截包含 shell 元字符（如 `;` `|` `$`）的 uploaddir 参数请求以临时缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45070/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46340/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-14933","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46340","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14933.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-14933.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14933.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2018/14xxx/CVE-2018-14933.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2018/14xxx/CVE-2018-14933.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/d8cd4a1ae21f91a5e3337a6b189b078a1a73a4aa/plugins/nuuo/nvrmini_firmware/CVE-2018-14933.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-14933.md","https://github.com/greekn/awakening-conscience/blob/1601e946bf8ce7e8dced6342a7e30ee8130d4e38/POC-T/script/cve-2018-14933.py","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-14933.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-14933.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-14933.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0333.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0087","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0087.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-14912","title":"CGit 目录遍历漏洞","description":"CGit 1.2.1 之前版本中的 cgit_clone_objects 函数存在目录遍历漏洞。当 `enable-http-clone=1` 配置项未关闭时，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标 CGit 实例发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在 URL 路径中构造 `../` 序列遍历目录，例如访问 `/cgit/cgit.cgi/git/objects/?path=../` 即可读取服务器上任意文件。该漏洞影响所有启用 HTTP Clone 功能的 CGit 部署，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需任何权限即可远程利用，获取服务器敏感信息。目前官方已在 CGit 1.2.1 版本中修复此问题，建议用户升级或关闭 `enable-http-clone` 选项。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-14912"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-08-03T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:41:52Z","remediation":"升级 CGit 至 1.2.1 或更高版本（当前最新为 1.3.1），从 https://git.zx2c4.com/cgit/ 下载源码重新编译部署。如无法立即升级，在 CGit 配置文件（通常为 /etc/cgitrc）中将 `enable-http-clone=1` 改为 `enable-http-clone=0` 以禁用 HTTP 克隆功能，同时在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）层面添加访问规则，拒绝外部对 `/git/objects/` 路径的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://bugs.chromium.org/p/project-zero/issues/detail?id=1627","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2018/08/msg00005.html","https://lists.zx2c4.com/pipermail/cgit/2018-August/004176.html","https://www.debian.org/security/2018/dsa-4263","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45195/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45195","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14912.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-14912.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14912.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-14912.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-14912-3316.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-14912-3317.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-14912-3315.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2018-14912.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/CGit/CVE-2018-14912.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-14912.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-14912.js"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0087.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0087.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0086","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0086.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-14728","title":"Responsive FileManager 服务器端请求伪造漏洞","description":"Responsive FileManager 9.13.1 及之前版本的 upload.php 存在服务端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 url 参数向任意内部或外部服务器发起 HTTP 请求，利用该漏洞可探测内网资产、读取云元数据接口（如 AWS 元数据服务），甚至结合其他漏洞实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响广泛部署的 Responsive FileManager 插件，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。目前已有公开 PoC 及自动化扫描模板。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-14728"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-08-03T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:41:31Z","remediation":"立即升级 Responsive FileManager 至 9.13.2 或更高版本，该版本在 upload.php 中增加了对 url 参数的校验，禁止访问内网地址和 file:///gopher:// 等非 HTTP(S) 协议。如无法升级，在 upload.php 中删除或注释对 url 参数的处理逻辑，并在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则拦截包含 file://、gopher://、169.254.169.254 等内网地址的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/148742/Responsive-Filemanager-9.13.1-Server-Side-Request-Forgery.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45103/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45103","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14728.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-14728.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14728.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-14728.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-14728-3314.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-14728-3309.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-14728-3313.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-14728-3310.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-14728.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/high/CVE-2018-14728.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Responsive FileManager/CVE-2018-14728.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0086.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0085","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0085.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-14574","title":"Django CommonMiddleware 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Django 的 CommonMiddleware 中间件存在开放重定向漏洞，当用户访问以斜杠结尾的 URL 时，Django 会自动将请求重定向到不带斜杠的 URL，但该过程中未对 HTTP Host 头进行充分验证，导致攻击者可通过构造恶意的 Host 头将用户重定向到任意外部网站。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱导用户点击特制链接即可实施钓鱼攻击。该漏洞影响 Django 1.11.15 之前版本及 2.0.8 之前版本，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。官方已在 Django 1.11.15 和 2.0.8 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-14574"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-08-03T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:41:12Z","remediation":"升级 Django 至 1.11.15 或 2.0.8 及以上版本，该版本修复了 CommonMiddleware 中未对 `next` 参数进行充分校验导致的任意 URL 跳转问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Nginx 反向代理层添加规则过滤包含可疑 `next` 参数的请求，或禁用 `django.middleware.common.CommonMiddleware` 中间件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/104970","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041403","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:0265","https://usn.ubuntu.com/3726-1/","https://www.debian.org/security/2018/dsa-4264","https://www.djangoproject.com/weblog/2018/aug/01/security-releases/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14574.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-14574.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/django/CVE-2018-14574/README.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/django/CVE-2018-14574/README.zh-cn.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14574.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-14574.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/low/cve-2018-14574-3308.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-14574-3307.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-14574-3304.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-14574-3306.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/开发框架漏洞/Django  2.0.8 任意URL跳转漏洞 CVE-2018-14574.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0085.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0085.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0085.toml"}]